Mobile platforms iOS, iPadOS, Android (Android TV), tvOS;
Desktop platforms Windows (Universal Windows Platform), Mac, Linux, ChromeOS;
Web platform WebGL;
Console platforms PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Xbox One, Xbox Series X/S, Nintendo Switch;
Virtual/Extended reality platforms Oculus, PlayStation VR, PlayStation VR2, Google's ARCore, Apple's ARKit, Windows Mixed Reality (HoloLens), Magic Leap, and via Unity XR SDK Steam VR, Google Cardboard.

